    45→ * - PUBLISH: Trader Dashboard + Create Signal + Portfolio + Referral (traders uniquement)
    46→ * - INSIGHTS & GROWTH: Analytics + School + Tax + Upgrade (progression)
    47→ *
    48→ * Features:
    49→ * - Badges dynamiques (plan requirements, counts, status)
    50→ * - État des sections persiste dans localStorage (Zustand)
    51→ * - Sections collapsibles
    52→ * - Tooltips sur les badges locked
    53→ */
    54→export function TradingSidebar({
    55→  allLinks,
    56→  hasTraderProfile,
    57→  activeSignalsCount,
    58→  userPlan,
    59→}: {
    60→  allLinks: SerializableGroup[];
